{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "93c08aa094aa0abddde2776eac6d790a9a3eb9cc455c786d17ddc59692b6bc49", "ja": "海美の場合：うみみんダッシュ☆", "zh": "海美的情况：海美冲刺☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ebbdcd00b863369f8bd28f7f9000bb7252da0d62896a5a74a600beaf27ec4b2e", "ja": "海美の対決用写真撮影日、亜利沙と琴葉も\nどんな一枚になるのか気になるからと参加。\n海美は撮影を皆に頼み、最高の瞬間を目指し\n千本ダッシュを始める。亜利沙も海美の最高\nの一枚のため、最後まで一緒に走り切る。", "zh": "海美的对决用照片拍摄日，亚利沙和琴叶也因为好奇最终会拍出怎样的照片而参加了进来。\n海美拜托大家负责拍摄，为了捕捉最棒的瞬间开始进行千本冲刺。亚利沙也为了拍下海美最棒的一张照片，陪她一起跑到最后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1ce06c82b88216345b194ca7309e512b614200b93b844ff99fa5c0fcc6b892be", "ja": "（BOT8は写真対決！　テーマは『自分史上最高の\n瞬間！　自己肯定感爆アゲな一枚♪』だ）", "zh": "（BOT8是照片对决！主题是“我人生中最棒的瞬间！让自我肯定感爆棚的一张♪”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1001_p", "source_sha256": "59f10ea82c03d44be68cd7995ee98a9203c490951091c27a4312720873d03420", "ja": "（今日は海美の撮影に協力する。スケジュール的に\n都合のついた亜利沙と琴葉も一緒だ）", "zh": "（今天要协助海美拍摄。时间安排比较合适的亚利沙和琴叶也会一起来）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "321f295d39eb850dfed2474bfdf824fe4725b33ebdce1f7621d1367c43ce4bbc", "ja": "ありりんと琴葉も付き合ってくれるの？\nありがとー！", "zh": "亚利沙和琴叶也愿意陪我吗？\n谢谢你们——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1003_017kth", "source_sha256": "239266d0efead474da14927b63152b3b96b3a3c4da66d8b0cc058ed8824d24b1", "ja": "今日はレッスンもお仕事も入ってないから。\nそれに海美ちゃんの考える最高の一枚、興味があって。", "zh": "因为今天既没有安排课程，也没有工作。再说，我也对海美心目中最棒的那一张很感兴趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1004_028ari", "source_sha256": "505c005ef3cb629c831914c9a7de276a27550d09d030b3c2771c661afc87fd78", "ja": "そうなんです！　海美ちゃんの爆アゲな一枚に、\nありさは興味しかありませんっ！", "zh": "就是说啊！海美超嗨的一张照片，\n亚利沙可是非常感兴趣的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e3383fc6c8a6d20a8dff700831b8be51b0e6a0d267594c619d439b522249d294", "ja": "そういうことらしい。場所を指定したってことは、\n撮影プランはもう決まってるのか？", "zh": "看来是这样。既然都指定地点了，拍摄方案已经定下来了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "be3caed0b9b6c3eb4d6d173a03209398b97d089ca8b128a56015dd598f3a8105", "ja": "うん！　私の最高の瞬間だったら、やっぱり運動！\n達成感があるのがいいなって！", "zh": "嗯！要说我最棒的瞬间，那当然是运动啦！我觉得还是要有成就感才好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "9b60d5d83df784275f3d65a4d3118261de2c46b1d1ff2c183add8125191c3ebb", "ja": "だから、ここで走り込みをするの！\n千本ダッシュ！", "zh": "所以，我要在这里进行跑步训练！\n冲刺一千次！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "0f4d474d36d784d9a7733298f61b2106f76a57a1e1b9a814b2a8b51e478a95ad", "ja": "なるほど、ありさもお供しますね！\nそれにしても、千本ですか～。……千本ですか！？", "zh": "原来如此，那我也陪你一起去吧！不过话说回来，要跑一千趟吗～……一千趟吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "8535acbee0432ebea05ddf55e19eb70371509a68280340e45aa76c8b5e4c8bd3", "ja": "うん！　さよちんが前にやったんだって！\nそれで～、私も負けてられないって～！", "zh": "嗯！听说纱代亲之前做过这个！\n所以～我也不能输给她～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1010_017kth", "source_sha256": "5ae4779a51574589d7f29d2528e2c368544c0bf3c0038a1f442b7a6f422d3b58", "ja": "紗代子、さすがだな……。\n私も見習わなくちゃ。", "zh": "纱代子真不愧是纱代子……\n我也得向她学习才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1011_p", "source_sha256": "3f0dc25dd2d6aa6b42d4b014bdbfbdeb6d7e5ace07c43d5633f3d0f1babfeddc", "ja": "あったな、そんなことも……。\nあの時はたしか、丸一日走ってたような？", "zh": "是有过那种事……  \n那时候我记得，好像跑了整整一天？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "91b57f2507030d12accad8ce11a3b6f9b9cd5564f4172c531bb6bb1087048d3b", "ja": "それでね、千本達成！っていう写真が\n撮りたいんだけど……。", "zh": "所以呢，我想拍一张“完成一千本！”的照片……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "effa41cc2db9019d719a9fe2c7c91fd5b2d6a9550d05a81ee014f1c761388d30", "ja": "{$P$}、写真は自分じゃなくて、\n誰かに撮ってもらってもいいの？", "zh": "{$P$}，照片不一定要自己拍，让别人帮忙拍也可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1014_p", "source_sha256": "f2678d31a3b68923732450ef4dd18c31f14138d31564787287cde39e3d3eb2eb", "ja": "構わないよ。\n撮影プランさえ本人が考えていれば問題はないし。", "zh": "没关系的。\n只要拍摄方案是本人想出来的，就没问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "02cf54773a7daa986975afc1b2731ebc1d67eaeb214c01a31c221026a9d7b71b", "ja": "よかった！　じゃあスマホで全然いいから、お願いね！\nてことで、早速の～……うみみんダーッシュ☆", "zh": "太好了！那用手机完全没问题，拜托啦！\n那么，马上就——……海美冲刺☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "45289cfe818d283428668983d1a4d54fa048360835e3774eb9cb045ff042b6d7", "ja": "ああっ、海美ちゃん！\nあっという間にお姿が米粒サイズに……！", "zh": "啊啊，海美！\n转眼间身影就变成米粒大小了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1017_017kth", "source_sha256": "65c9b03ecc74a73a8abc6ad53061912fcc450232ba154ec6a98e7abce8f70dac", "ja": "と、とりあえず、私たちも行こう！\n写真も頼まれたし、しっかり見届けないと！", "zh": "总、总之，我们也走吧！\n既然还拜托我们拍照，就得好好见证才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1018_p", "source_sha256": "ac111fa1128f164d303cdf8ee7c94692443465d773bea8e71e35a525f791155f", "ja": "あ、そんなことしなくても……。\n行っちゃったか……。", "zh": "啊，不用做到那种程度……  \n已经走了吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "a77a056f0d0babe13ec84e7e0deac47de1d249fc5310cba2b4a4363f257c6d27", "ja": "高坂選手、まずは好スタートです！\n……えへへ、なーんちゃって♪　……あれ？", "zh": "高坂选手，首先是个好开头！……嘿嘿，开玩笑的♪……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "98aa43d52c7f825b1d9fbd745c639c1e5f227fd669dcf36a2d9061dc3798f738", "ja": "ぜえ、ぜえ、さすがは海美ちゃん……でも、ありさも\n離されません！　そこにアイドルちゃんがいる限り！", "zh": "呼、呼……不愧是海美……不过，亚利沙也不会被甩开！只要偶像还在那里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "c73ffe555b775c47ce76de7bc1ba6992a9b28a192c9c3ac0dd4ffeb5224efdac", "ja": "ありりん！　なかなかやるね？\nよぉーし、うみみんダッシュ・ターボだーっ☆", "zh": "亚里琳！还挺能干嘛？  \n好——海美冲刺·涡轮模式启动啦——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1022_028ari", "source_sha256": "593ff721039aca80e10f29dfc83053df5bfb5d9d6afeee42c24f4663227f36b0", "ja": "ひいいいいいいいっ！？\nギアをあげないでください～！！", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！？  \n请不要再加速了～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1023_017kth", "source_sha256": "3da9c465054399f76178acd40eb57f7210c98857b8905f8b25ff9d5cb04fbc19", "ja": "はあ、はあ……。\nだ、だめ……すこし、休憩を……っ。", "zh": "哈啊，哈啊……  \n不、不行……让我休息一下……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1024_017kth", "source_sha256": "5998974cfe04ec4de857d2db1a6e1c0a42769668d71ca5b9caf632af7822c332", "ja": "写真を頼まれてたけど……\nさすがに、海美ちゃんには追いつけない……。", "zh": "虽然答应了要拍照……  \n但果然还是追不上海美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1025_p", "source_sha256": "b0bcb6a5a0f4b162ad8ec96badbc526077939a02998dd6a79168c3891318a04f", "ja": "琴葉、無理しなくていいぞ。\nあのスピードで走れるのは海美だけだろうし……。", "zh": "琴叶，不用勉强自己。  \n能以那种速度奔跑的，应该也只有海美吧……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1026_p", "source_sha256": "a516ef28748bac54846520aba8c40d6f8f12dd61f92d47ed07c49c2cc7ed1ac6", "ja": "それに、砂浜を周回してるだけなんだから。\n写真はここで待って撮ればいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "而且只是在沙滩上绕圈跑而已。照片在这里等着拍不就好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1027_017kth", "source_sha256": "5aa49a47240a612ccd28df852cb16f9950d310a81b674a6e3b4dbbae3683da3b", "ja": "はっ……！？", "zh": "哈……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "b222433f5bf974039b935e62782db231b7adb60ae2e6eede80bbcf380ff1ccfc", "ja": "まだついてこれてる！？　すごいすごーい！\nそれなら～、うみみんダッシュ・ハイターボーっ☆", "zh": "还能跟上吗！？好厉害好厉害！\n那就——海美冲刺·最高涡轮——☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "6675eb3d9426ff438ad9500719fe13a9034e54f6d8c45211ba847219d35aead6", "ja": "し、しぬ……！　しんでしまう……！\nでも、海美ちゃんの、最高の一枚のため……！", "zh": "要、要死了……！要死掉了……！\n可是，为了海美最棒的照片……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1030_028ari", "source_sha256": "ae6ef1d27d6cbf173fab3fc6575f229901d3a5c8a91e697a42685ccc3927fdd4", "ja": "ふ、ふ、ふ……ふおおおおおおおおっ！！", "zh": "呼、呼、呼……呼哦哦哦哦哦哦哦哦——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1031_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1032_029umi", "source_sha256": "0b452b1136b2fca810ea8b0b29c70f0c231da1d2fb47b48b8c2baab4611639d5", "ja": "よーし、これで……千本ダッシュ達成！", "zh": "好——这样就……完成一千次冲刺了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1033_se", "source_sha256": "ecb1b38e2a1a2fa43fe11e5367f8d8786dff2e95173dab4d949046fcc0fc98a2", "ja": "パシャパシャパシャパシャッ！", "zh": "咔嚓咔嚓咔嚓咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1034_029umi", "source_sha256": "5538a1c30f2883f33833dbfc842a53f596036ebd6ea281237a353ed0e6651ba1", "ja": "あっ、そうだ写真！　撮ってくれてありがとう！\n{$P$}、琴葉！", "zh": "啊，对了，还有照片！谢谢你帮忙拍照！\n{$P$}、琴叶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1035_028ari", "source_sha256": "69e8f4b8aa7cfd697368d6a732924827909c087cb9b572768aba332323f6d8ff", "ja": "と、撮れた……よう、ですね……！\nぜえっ……ぜえっ……！", "zh": "拍、拍到了……好、好像是……！\n呼……呼……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1036_p", "source_sha256": "cae218f273f0423a523bda06d7fded9f013ee0875d7c3aa198e01d5b7a42bfbc", "ja": "亜利沙は周回遅れになったものの、\nずっと止まらなかったな……。大丈夫か？", "zh": "虽然亚利沙落后了一圈，但一直都没有停下来啊……没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1037_028ari", "source_sha256": "6dc50abf58e39c855cdca6391bda44f18b9dc965fc74a42b216ab15f126daa14", "ja": "げほっ……だ、大丈夫では……ごほごほっ！\nまったく……ありません……っ！", "zh": "咳咳……没、没事……咳咳！\n完全……没有……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1038_017kth", "source_sha256": "09c865386807393ca65e13f5931295761dc5517625aafd76e961e096d804c0f1", "ja": "亜利沙もお疲れさま。でも、どうしてそこまで？\n写真は今みたいに、ここで待っていても……。", "zh": "亚利沙也辛苦了。不过，为什么要做到这种地步呢？\n拍照的话，像现在这样在这里等着也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1039_028ari", "source_sha256": "15510491940283691e7679bbd23132770ec619e97778fbe3950f52bccbd4fe36", "ja": "そうなんですケド……海美ちゃんは、誰かと一緒に\n走った方が、気持ちがのるかと……思いまして……。", "zh": "是这样的，不过……我想，海美和别人一起跑的话，可能会更有干劲……所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1040_029umi", "source_sha256": "89fd31a3bbff3559e8f5440b2f14498d88d33341b35ce21b8631cf94815817ee", "ja": "あ、うん！　ありりんが必死で追いかけてきてくれて、\nテンションあがったよ！", "zh": "啊，对！有亚里琳拼命追上来，我一下子就来劲了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1041_p", "source_sha256": "b057f4fa403a9cc3509aafd278c27833ef44a4aca9ed7188956404e24b257eed", "ja": "なるほど。海美の一枚をよりいいものにするために、\n付き合っていたのか……。", "zh": "原来如此。为了让海美的照片变得更好，所以才陪着她的吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1042_029umi", "source_sha256": "145d51dd9e453ad70decb3e7b17570b3dece7c7969c674b07fcaa053ae9946fc", "ja": "そうだったんだ……。\nうう、ありがとう、ありりん～！", "zh": "原来是这样啊……  \n呜呜，谢谢你，亚里里～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1043_028ari", "source_sha256": "f892704514850ad37b85f3d22368307dd3e76ab6f1e63d0aab44954e7dd47ef9", "ja": "いえいえ、アイドルオタクとしては、当然のこと……\nお役に立てたのなら、本望です……。", "zh": "哪里哪里，作为偶像宅，这都是理所当然的……\n能帮上忙的话，我就死而无憾了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1044_028ari", "source_sha256": "fb0146193b69e240cce828f5f0adbcf2a48e1045618d9dcbcfb5901bfbab215a", "ja": "でももう限界ですっ。……がくっ。", "zh": "可是已经到极限了……咕！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1045_029umi", "source_sha256": "f27015c60c969918d2d1170cec930b2650a6bcd7f300952cd6e074bbdd538407", "ja": "ありりーん！？", "zh": "亚利纱——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1046_017kth", "source_sha256": "bc601e8d58174e247b2088a8563b9205ef8c66366d379641d6051560f04fdc01", "ja": "亜利沙ー！？", "zh": "亚利沙——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1047_p", "source_sha256": "5cf4f869984b4c900f535c3e1bad079ae519fd603bb54756e6cf103cdc9e135a", "ja": "（亜利沙の執念とも言える行動のおかげで、\n海美の一枚はかなりいい出来ばえとなった）", "zh": "（多亏了亜利沙那简直称得上执着的行动，海美的这张照片拍得相当不错）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0422_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0422_story_02_1048_p", "source_sha256": "81e54d25ff6909a0bf980327e3d4c597aab3ff298bf2dbeabb2bda2a2cad7f38", "ja": "（思いがけず気合いの入ったスタートになった……。\n引き続き、爆アゲな一枚を見守っていこう！）", "zh": "（真没想到会以这么干劲十足的方式开始……接下来也继续期待这张超燃的照片吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
